<title>USA: Gray expands buyback program by 1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Gray expands buyback program by 1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, Ga. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gray Communications Systems Inc said on Tuesday that it doubled the amount of shares authorized for repurchase, adding one million shares of either Class A or Class B to the program.</p>
<p>The one million shares earlier authorized for repurchase all had to be Class B common stock.</p>
<p>Under the earlier program, Gray so far has repurchased 172,300 shares, which it is holding in treasury. The company plans to use the shares it buys back for its employee benefit plan and for stock options.</p>
<p>Gray shares were at 16-7/8 in early trading on Tuesday, down 1/8.</p>
